  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: exactly 16 _make_edge_id helpers remain (fortran, hlsl, glsl, nix, r_lang, wgsl, graphql, sql, xml_config, json_config, make, css, toml_config, dockerfile, cmake, cuda), each returning f'edge:sha256:{...[:16]}'. ir.py now has mint_edge_id(src,dst,edge_type,line) (da2fa2f837) with a fixed four-fact payload, the natural home for a payload-taking variant; check_id_construction judges edge templates statically. MECHANISM: edge-id format string copied per producer instead of owned by one payload-taking factory."  # f4ac
